-young-hearts-are-breaking-with-dr.-kirk-milhoan-md-phd..html", "webpage_url_basename": "v25742r-full-episode-62-young-hearts-are-breaking-with-dr.-kirk-milhoan-md-phd..html", "webpage_url_domain": "rumble.com", "extractor": "RumbleEmbed", "extractor_key": "RumbleEmbed", "view_count": 24006, "like_count": 186, "dislike_count": 3, "description": "VSRF Weekly Update with Steve Kirsch\nJoin Us LIVE!\nThursdays 7PM EST\nRegister: https://www.VacSafety.org\nThursday, January 12, 2022\n7pm Eastern / 4pm PacificShow more Dr. Milhoan, MD, PhD, FACC, FAAP has a PhD in Cardiovascular Physiology and Pharmacology. His dissertation was on the mechanism of inflammation in myocardial ischemia.He and his wife, Dr. Kimberly Milhoan, started \"For Hearts and Souls,\" a non-profit international organization to diagnose and treat children with heart defects across the globe. Dr. Milhoan, as the Senior Pastor of Calvary Chapel South Maui, kept their doors open during the Covid lockdowns in early 2020 by providing food pantry services to the community 7 days a week. Kirk and Kim continue their medical outreach, including a Free Medical Clinic in Hawaii as well as numerous international pediatric cardiac missions.\n****\nVSRF's Covid Litigation Conference\nMarch 25-26, 2023\nAtlanta\nhttps://www.vacsafety.org/events Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/1/J/1/N/U/J1NUh.qR4e.1-small-Full-Episode-62-Young-Heart.jpg", "display_id": "v22kz9j", "fulltitle": "Full Episode #62: \"Young Hearts Are Breaking\" with Dr. Kirk Milhoan, MD, PhD.", "duration_string": "1:46:35", "upload_date": "20230113", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1777619957, "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/2/J/1/N/U/J1NUh.gaa.mp4", "format_id": "mp4-720p", "fps": 29.97, "tbr": 1964, "filesize": 1570704807, "width": 1280, "height": 720, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "resolution": "1280x720", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "http_headers"